\source{wang2022}

\note{
\begin{itemize}
\item The circuit is kind of bizarre
\item Duplicate token and induction heads (at S2): notice that ``John'' appeared before
\item S-inhibition heads (at END): attend to S2 and tell the name movers not to attend to John
